OL,3,GNEWSACouncil tax freeze proposed by
OL,4,Acity council
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham City Council is proposing to
OL,7,Ffreeze council tax for the next
OL,8,Ffinancial year, it has been announced.
OL,10,FDraft budget documents published on
OL,11,FMonday show that, if the plan is
OL,12,Fapproved, the authority's share of
OL,13,Fbills for an average Band D property
OL,14,Fwould remain at #2,342.08 for 2027-28.
OL,16,FThe Labour-run council, which
OL,17,Feffectively declared itself bankrupt in
OL,18,F2023, said it had made "major
OL,19,Fimprovements" to its finances and
OL,20,Freceived increased funding from central
OL,21,Fgovernment.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
