OL,3,GNEWSACouncil tax freeze proposed by
OL,4,Acity council
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy leader Ethan Radford said it was
OL,7,F"only right that those benefits are
OL,8,Fpassed on to the Nottingham taxpayer".
